sequenceDiagram
    participant fed0 as fed0 (bootstrap)
    participant fed1 as fed1 (joiner)
    Note over fed0: start with FEDERATION_BOOTSTRAP=true<br/>generate self-signed TLS cert<br/>SHA-256 fingerprint -> local FederationMember
    Note over fed1: start with FEDERATION_JOIN_ENDPOINT=fed0
    fed1->>fed0: JoinFederation (mTLS handshake)
    fed0-->>fed1: accept + own cert fingerprint
    fed1->>fed0: own cert fingerprint (in JoinRequest)
    Note over fed0,fed1: both now hold the peer's<br/>cert_fingerprint via Raft<br/>(no shared CA needed)
